# Generated QA artefacts. The Newman report embeds live JWTs and demo
# credentials from the run, and is ~3MB — never commit it.
qa/reports/

# Android signing material. The keystore IS the app's identity — losing it means
# no future update can be installed over an existing one, and leaking it lets
# anyone sign an APK as SedBank. Keep both out of the repo, back the keystore up
# somewhere durable, and give CI the base64 of it as a secret.
keystore.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
